{'symbol': 'BALL', 'date': '2022-06-01 08:23:00', 'title': "BALL CORPORATION AND NOVELIS JOIN WORLD ECONOMIC FORUM'S FIRST MOVERS COALITION, ENCOURAGE VALUE CHAIN COLLABORATION TO DRIVE DECARBONIZATION IN ALUMINUM SECTOR", 'text': "WESTMINSTER, COLO. , JUNE 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BALL CORPORATION\xa0(NYSE: BALL) AND NOVELIS, BOTH OF WHICH RECENTLY JOINED THE WORLD ECONOMIC FORUM'S NEWLY FORMED ALUMINUM BRANCH OF THE FIRST MOVERS COALITION (FMC), ARE CALLING ON INDUSTRY PEERS TO PRIORITIZE CIRCULARITY AND ENCOURAGING THEM TO JOIN THE FMC."}